{"seq":4,"slug":"major-works","title":"苏格拉底·major-works","stage":"DONE","category":"socrates","categoryLabel":"苏格拉底","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/major-works","rating":{"composite":3.84,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/20_socrates/4_major-works","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"苏格拉底-主要著作\">苏格拉底·主要著作</h1><p>苏格拉底&quot;不著一字&quot;——他没有留下任何亲笔作品。因此本 hub 把通常意义上的&quot;主要著作&quot;重构为一个更准确的对象：<strong>记述苏格拉底的史料体系，及其批判方法</strong>。换言之，这里讨论的不是苏格拉底&quot;写了什么&quot;，而是&quot;我们凭什么文献认识他、这些文献各自可信到什么程度&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-vs-兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub vs 兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>苏格拉底人物专题共六个 hub，本 hub 是其中的&quot;文献与方法&quot;支柱：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>兄弟 hub</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">1 生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>他经历了什么（含审判、死亡）</td>\n<td>本 hub 提供&quot;史实从何而知&quot;的来源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">2 核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>他在哲学史上做了什么</td>\n<td>本 hub 提供这些贡献的文献依据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3 思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>他的诘问法、自知无知等思想内容</td>\n<td>本 hub 展示这些思想保存在哪些文本里</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">5 影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>后世如何承袭他</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6 争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>历史苏格拉底能否重建（哲学评价）</td>\n<td>本 hub 是其操作层：实际怎么读史料</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话边界：<strong>思想内容去第3 hub，文献与可信度来本 hub，历史重建的哲学争论去第6 hub。</strong> 本 hub 与第6 hub 的&quot;苏格拉底问题&quot;互为表里——本 hub 给操作判据，第6 hub 给哲学评价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内容地图\">内容地图</h2><p>本 hub 三章，从&quot;为何没有著作&quot;出发，逐一考察三大史料来源：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Z[&quot;主要著作 = 史料体系&quot;] --&gt; C1[1 不著一字]&#10;    Z --&gt; C2[2 柏拉图来源]&#10;    Z --&gt; C3[3 其他来源]&#10;    C1 --&gt; A1[为何不著一字: 动机与证据强度]&#10;    C1 --&gt; A2[&quot;苏格拉底问题: 史料批判总框架★&quot;]&#10;    C2 --&gt; B1[&quot;《申辩篇》: 使命自述·最可信单篇&quot;]&#10;    C2 --&gt; B2[早期对话录: 方法现场]&#10;    C3 --&gt; D1[色诺芬: 务实侧影·第二证人]&#10;    C3 --&gt; D2[&quot;阿里斯托芬《云》: 敌意侧影·成见档案&quot;]&#10;    A2 -. 判据 .-&gt; B1&#10;    A2 -. 判据 .-&gt; B2&#10;    A2 -. 判据 .-&gt; D1&#10;    A2 -. 判据 .-&gt; D2\">graph TD\n    Z[\"主要著作 = 史料体系\"] --&gt; C1[1 不著一字]\n    Z --&gt; C2[2 柏拉图来源]\n    Z --&gt; C3[3 其他来源]\n    C1 --&gt; A1[为何不著一字: 动机与证据强度]\n    C1 --&gt; A2[\"苏格拉底问题: 史料批判总框架★\"]\n    C2 --&gt; B1[\"《申辩篇》: 使命自述·最可信单篇\"]\n    C2 --&gt; B2[早期对话录: 方法现场]\n    C3 --&gt; D1[色诺芬: 务实侧影·第二证人]\n    C3 --&gt; D2[\"阿里斯托芬《云》: 敌意侧影·成见档案\"]\n    A2 -. 判据 .-&gt; B1\n    A2 -. 判据 .-&gt; B2\n    A2 -. 判据 .-&gt; D1\n    A2 -. 判据 .-&gt; D2</pre><p>★ <a href=\"teaching-without-writing/the-socratic-problem\">苏格拉底问题</a> 是全 hub 的中枢：它给出评估一切史料的统一判据（来源立场、文体计量、亚里士多德旁证、双证人交叉），下游四篇都以它为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>前置</strong>：建议先读 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/knowing-and-ignorance/i-know-that-i-know-nothing\">思想与方法·自知无知</a> 与 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/the-midwifery/the-elenchus\">诘问法</a>，掌握苏格拉底&quot;破而不立&quot;的思想内核，才能看懂为何史料如此分歧。</li>\n<li><strong>主线</strong>：<a href=\"teaching-without-writing/why-he-wrote-nothing\">为何不著一字</a> → <a href=\"teaching-without-writing/the-socratic-problem\">苏格拉底问题</a>（务必精读，它是判据）→ <a href=\"in-plato/the-apology\">《申辩篇》</a> → <a href=\"in-plato/the-early-dialogues\">早期对话录</a> → <a href=\"in-others/xenophon-memorabilia\">色诺芬</a> → <a href=\"in-others/aristophanes-clouds\">阿里斯托芬《云》</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>延伸</strong>：读完回到 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/the-socratic-problem/the-historical-socrates\">争议与评价·苏格拉底问题</a>，从操作层升到哲学评价层。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"核心要点\">核心要点</h2><ul>\n<li>三大来源呈现三个不同的苏格拉底：柏拉图哲学化、色诺芬务实化、阿里斯托芬讽刺化；差异即证据。</li>\n<li>单一来源不可直接等同历史真实；<strong>双证人交叉</strong>（柏拉图×色诺芬）与<strong>外部旁证</strong>（亚里士多德）是最实用的还原工具。</li>\n<li>连敌意的《云》也有不可替代的价值——它保存了弟子辩护文删去的公众成见。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"teaching-without-writing","title":"Teaching Without Writing","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/major-works/teaching-without-writing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-he-wrote-nothing","title":"为何不著一字","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/major-works/teaching-without-writing/why-he-wrote-nothing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-socratic-problem","title":"苏格拉底问题","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/major-works/teaching-without-writing/the-socratic-problem"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"in-plato","title":"In Plato","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/major-works/in-plato","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-apology","title":"《申辩篇》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/major-works/in-plato/the-apology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-early-dialogues","title":"早期对话录","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/major-works/in-plato/the-early-dialogues"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"in-others","title":"In Others","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/major-works/in-others","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"xenophon-memorabilia","title":"色诺芬《回忆苏格拉底》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/major-works/in-others/xenophon-memorabilia"},{"seq":2,"slug":"aristophanes-clouds","title":"阿里斯托芬《云》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/major-works/in-others/aristophanes-clouds"}]}]}